  ___________TTTTTTTT=sTs=gTTTT_
  ___________TTTTTTTTTygggggTTT_
  _________________TTTgggggggTT_
  __________________TTggggggsTT_
  _____________TTTTTTTggggg==TT_
  _____________TTTTTTTggggg=TTT_
  _____________TTIggg==gggggTTT_
  _____________TT=ggg==gggggTT__
